      "changeType": "new",
      "active": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Thompson Rome has opened with 69 rooms, according to Hyatt, which billed the property as the Thompson Hotels brand's first in Italy. The hotel is owned and operated by AG Group s.r.l. and Rossifin Group."
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        "Thompson Rome is a 69-room property.",
        "It is the Thompson Hotels brand's first hotel in Italy, per Hyatt.",
        "Ownership and operations are held by AG Group s.r.l. and Rossifin Group."
      ]
