      "title": "Capital One 20% Transfer Bonus to British Airways Avios (1:1.2), Reported Through Oct. 31, 2026",
      "summary": "Doctor of Credit reports that Capital One is offering a 20% transfer bonus to British Airways Avios through October 31, 2026. The standard 1,000:1,000 transfer ratio becomes 1,000:1,200, so 1,000 Capital One miles yields 1,200 Avios. The reported promotion window is October 1–31, 2026.",
      "verification": "reported",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-10-27T02:29:11.000Z",
      "effectiveAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
