      "paragraphs": [
        "Doctor of Credit reports that the bonus applies to Capital One miles transfers into British Airways Avios and changes the usual 1,000-to-1,000 ratio to 1,000-to-1,200. The publication lists the deal window as October 1 through October 31, 2026.",
